[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21242.67, "timestamp": "05:54:02", "text": "记住谁是谁，谁是谁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21246.15, "timestamp": "05:54:06", "text": "这是因为这个名字现在是中文的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21248.708, "timestamp": "05:54:08", "text": "中文名字有不同的名称。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21251.11, "timestamp": "05:54:11", "text": "呃，就像某种含义之类的，我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21253.27, "timestamp": "05:54:13", "text": "知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21259.03, "timestamp": "05:54:19", "text": "对，还有汉字什么的，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21262.03, "timestamp": "05:54:22", "text": "是的，我50岁了，我知道50岁了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21265.35, "timestamp": "05:54:25", "text": "是的。我正在学习习惯看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21268.948, "timestamp": "05:54:28", "text": "现在就是用户名了。而且你还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21273.11, "timestamp": "05:54:33", "text": "七就像你身上有十七岁之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21275.868, "timestamp": "05:54:35", "text": "是的，那会有点帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21277.948, "timestamp": "05:54:37", "text": "少量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21281.47, "timestamp": "05:54:41", "text": "嗯，是的。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21285.19, "timestamp": "05:54:45", "text": "今天我在想我们会做什么。我们可以呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21288.15, "timestamp": "05:54:48", "text": "完成主线任务。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21290.59, "timestamp": "05:54:50", "text": "我觉得我做到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21294.07, "timestamp": "05:54:54", "text": "嗯，我想我做了我的……呃，该怎么称呼呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21297.788, "timestamp": "05:54:57", "text": "它？日常的。是的，我完成了每日练习。"}]